# Key NAMES and example values only. Never a real secret value — that rule is
# the product's, not just this file's: DevCon reads this file and never `.env`.

# Public origin this is served from, used for the canonical tag, the OG image
# URL and sitemap.xml. Build-time, and public — it ends up in the HTML.
#
# Defaults to http://localhost:3000 when unset (see lib/site.ts), which is
# correct for local development and wrong for anything you deploy. Set it to
# the real origin, with the scheme and no trailing slash.
#
# Getting this wrong is not cosmetic: a canonical tag pointing at a host you do
# not control tells search engines that host is the original.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com
